  "description": "A snowman girl with a human soul, Seol-Ha! Because her body melts when it heats up, she has been in love with her first love for 100 years. There is only one way Sublingual can become a human. To achieve love!? However, unlike the previous life, which was affectionate Lee Ram doesn't know Seol-Ha's heart... Even Woo-Jo, the God of work, who bickered every day shows a different attitude than before. Will Seol-Ha be able to safely achieve love? \n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
